their phones at all times\, and can access their phones throughout the show
 
 at designated Phone Use Areas in the venue. All phones will be re-secured 
 
in Yondr cases before returning to the performance space. Anyone seen using
 
 a cellphone during the performance will be escorted out of the venue. We a
 
ppreciate your cooperation in creating a phone-free viewing experience. DO 
 
